# UI conventions

- Server Components by default; client components only for interactivity/state/browser APIs.
- Keep components focused; extract hooks/helpers instead of growing files.
- Use Tailwind utility classes already in the project; avoid new CSS frameworks.
- Do not introduce shadcn or component libraries unless asked.
- Colocate tests as `*.test.ts(x)` next to the unit under test when practical.
